voice/out/*.wav are the device prompts of the AI为什么100 mascot "小奇" (Xiaoqi). They were
synthesized with the Microsoft neural voice zh-CN-YunxiaNeural through the open-source
edge-tts tool (voice/gen-voice.mjs). If you build a commercial product, consider
re-generating the prompts with a TTS service whose terms cover your use, or recording your own.

Third-party components used by the firmware (fetched by the ESP-IDF component manager, not bundled):
- ESP-IDF, esp_codec_dev, esp_io_expander_tca95xx_16bit, led_strip (Espressif Systems), Apache License 2.0.
